  "confidence": 0.85,
  "rationale": "The counterparty name exactly matches the sanctioned entity Vnesheconombank (OFAC-17015), but the counterparty country (NL) does not match the listed party's associated countries (CN, IN, RU). A screener risk signal indicates a sanctioned jurisdiction link in the payment reference with high confidence (0.9), above the policy threshold of 0.5. The payment reference lacks documentary evidence standards. Since this is a payment alert with a risk signal above threshold, escalation is required.",
