    "If the payment reference provided documentary evidence (check reference, document number, date) showing the counterparty is not the sanctioned entity",
    "If the counterparty country matched a listed country (CN, IN, RU) making counterparty_match true",
    "If the screener risk signal confidence was below 0.5 threshold"
